01:37:00.000 --> 01:37:05.340
The point is, Keyes believes Cicchetti is the one he's been looking for.

01:37:06.980 --> 01:37:09.020
He'll have him in the gas chamber before he knows what's happened to him.

01:37:09.870 --> 01:37:11.350
What's happening to me all this time?

01:37:12.190 --> 01:37:19.560
Don't be silly, baby. What do you think's gonna happen to you?

01:37:20.580 --> 01:37:21.680
You helped him do the murder, didn't you?

01:37:22.810 --> 01:37:25.560
That's what Keyes thinks. If it's good enough for Keyes, it's good enough for me.

01:37:26.350 --> 01:37:29.050
Maybe it's not good enough for me, Walter. Maybe I don't go for the idea.

01:37:30.890 --> 01:37:31.990
Maybe I'd rather talk.

01:37:32.890 --> 01:37:34.250
Sometimes people are where they can't talk.

01:37:35.240 --> 01:37:36.240
Under six feet of dirt, maybe.

01:37:37.780 --> 01:37:39.780
