01:37:50.720 --> 01:37:51.480
It's all taken care of.

01:37:51.600 --> 01:37:55.380
Would make everything lovely for you, wouldn't it?

01:37:55.480 --> 01:37:55.660
Right.

01:37:56.820 --> 01:37:58.740
It's got to be done before that suit of yours comes to trial.

01:37:59.420 --> 01:37:59.960
And Lola gets a chance.

01:38:01.590 --> 01:38:04.150
before they trip you up in the stand and you start to go in and drag me down with you.

01:38:04.270 --> 01:38:06.570
Maybe I had Cicchetti here so they won't get a chance to trip me up,

01:38:06.650 --> 01:38:07.810
